<title>GERMANY: German Jan-May coffee imports up at 4.82 mln bags.</title>
<headline>German Jan-May coffee imports up at 4.82 mln bags.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German net green coffee imports from outside the EU totalled 4.82 million bags in January-May 1996 compared with 4.66 million a year earlier, the DKV coffee association said on Monday.</p>
<p>Imports of 1.02 million bags in May were up from 902,114 bags in April and up from 965,661 in May 1995.</p>
<p>Colombia shipped 222,187 bags in May after 178,801 in April, El Salvador 117,634 (103,575), Honduras 93,613 (35,999), Kenya 71,696 (46,502), and Guatemala 62,742 (54,883).</p>
<p>Brazil was in 12th position with 28,939 bags (26,368 bags in April).--Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
